    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR addresses issue #1299 by adding the `sign_extend: true` property to instruction encoding metadata for instructions that use signed immediates in their operations. The changes aim to align encoding metadata with the actual sign extension behavior indicated by `$signed(imm)` usage in the operation sections.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Added `sign_extend: true` to 35 instruction YAML files across I, C, F, Zfh, and Zicbop extensions\n- All changes are metadata-only additions to the encoding variable definitions\n- Includes arithmetic, logical, load, store, branch, and prefetch instructions\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 35 out of 35 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/addi.yaml | Added sign_extend property to arithmetic immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/addiw.yaml | Added sign_extend property to word-width arithmetic immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/andi.yaml | Added sign_extend property to logical AND immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/ori.yaml | Added sign_extend property to logical OR immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/xori.yaml | Added sign_extend property to logical XOR immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/slti.yaml | Added sign_extend property to set-less-than immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sltiu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to set-less-than immediate unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lui.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load upper immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/auipc.yaml | Added sign_extend property to add upper immediate to PC instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/jalr.yaml | Added sign_extend property to jump and link register instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/bgeu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to branch greater-equal unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/bltu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to branch less-than unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lb.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load byte instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lbu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load byte unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lh.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load halfword instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lhu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load halfword unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lw.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load word instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/lwu.yaml | Added sign_extend property to load word unsigned instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/ld.yaml | Added sign_extend property to both RV32 and RV64 load doubleword encodings |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sb.yaml | Added sign_extend property to store byte instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sh.yaml | Added sign_extend property to store halfword instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sw.yaml | Added sign_extend property to store word instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/I/sd.yaml | Added sign_extend property to RV32 store doubleword encoding |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.addi.yaml | Added sign_extend property to compressed add immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.addi16sp.yaml | Added sign_extend property to compressed stack pointer adjust instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.andi.yaml | Added sign_extend property to compressed AND immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.li.yaml | Added sign_extend property to compressed load immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/C/c.lui.yaml | Added sign_extend property to compressed load upper immediate instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/F/flw.yaml | Added sign_extend property to floating-point load word instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/F/fsw.yaml | Added sign_extend property to floating-point store word instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zfh/flh.yaml | Added sign_extend property to floating-point load halfword instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zfh/fsh.yaml | Added sign_extend property to floating-point store halfword instruction |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zicbop/prefetch.i.yaml | **INCORRECT**: Added sign_extend property incompatible with operation using `$signed(imm << 5)` |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zicbop/prefetch.r.yaml | **INCORRECT**: Added sign_extend property incompatible with operation using `$signed(imm << 5)` |\r\n| spec/std/isa/inst/Zicbop/prefetch.w.yaml | **INCORRECT**: Added sign_extend property incompatible with operation using `$signed(imm << 5)` |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv-software-src/riscv-unified-db/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
